Derived from src/devtmpfs/ (the PLZ110 6.12 port); same adaptations, plus:
- 6.1 VFS calls take &init_user_ns instead of &nop_mnt_idmap, and
  is_blockdev() is local as in the 6.1 source.
- Loading is gated like the GKI namespace payloads: gki=1 and a matching
  android14-6.1 release (or the build VM), with the userspace ABI check.
- kprobe mode (auto on Samsung EL2, or kprobe_hooks=1): device_add and
  device_del get entry kprobes that move the PC to the replacements; the
  native functions are reached through x16-marked stubs. No kernel or
  module text is written.
